        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sir William James Ingram\n- Companies: The Illustrated London News\n- Topics: Illustrated weekly news magazines\n\nFacts:\n- The Illustrated London News first appeared on Saturday 14 May 1842.\n- The Illustrated London News was the world's first illustrated weekly news magazine.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, lived from 27 October 1847 to 18 December 1924.\n- Sir William James Ingram served as Managing Director of The Illustrated London News.\n- The Illustrated London News appeared weekly until summer 1971.",
