        "original_id": "cea55113-263d-5fc0-849b-5f0153086a3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sir William James Ingram, Herbert Ingram\n- Companies: The Illustrated London News\n- Organizations: House of Commons\n- Roles: Managing Director, Liberal politician, Baronet\n\nFacts:\n- Herbert Ingram founded The Illustrated London News.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, was born on 27 October 1847.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, sat in the House of Commons in three periods between 1878 and 1895 as a Liberal politician.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, was Managing Director of The Illustrated London News.\n- Sir William James Ingram, 1st Baronet, died on 18 December 1924.\n- The Illustrated London News appeared weekly until 1971.\n- The Illustrated London News was published less frequently after 1971.\n- The Illustrated London News ceased publication in 2003.",
